{"n":112,"videoId":"VjORHAjQqtU","question":"How Many Hours A Day Do You Use Your Phone?","method":"premiere","answers":[{"t":8.72,"dur":4.92,"text":"My time of sleep is eight hours Let's see... 16 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":13.64,"dur":0.96,"text":"2 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":15.93,"dur":1.08,"text":"8 Hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":17.02,"dur":1.17,"text":"1 Hour","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":18.18,"dur":3.92,"text":"I think about 6 hours straight","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":22.11,"dur":3.67,"text":"I only don’t use it when I'm sleeping because we are frontliners [civil service]","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":25.78,"dur":3.92,"text":"We get inquires, we get phone calls 24 hours a day","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":29.7,"dur":1.58,"text":"probably 8 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":32.66,"dur":1.17,"text":"8 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":33.83,"dur":2.63,"text":"I don't have a phone","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":36.45,"dur":4.34,"text":"Depends if I have school or not","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":40.79,"dur":2.0,"text":"But if there's school, like, 6 to 7 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":44.25,"dur":0.88,"text":"Yeah, same as him","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":45.13,"dur":4.0,"text":"-and no school? 10 plus","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":49.13,"dur":3.3,"text":"15 hours because my phone is a necessity for our school work","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":52.43,"dur":1.21,"text":"5 or 4 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":55.35,"dur":4.3,"text":"During our work, when we answer... the call of our superiour","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":60.52,"dur":2.88,"text":"our family etc etc","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":63.4,"dur":3.88,"text":"I limit myself until 8 hours only","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":67.28,"dur":3.75,"text":"Usually I'm on my computer a lot [more], then my cellphone","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":71.03,"dur":1.63,"text":"4 to 5 hours a day on my phone","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":73.66,"dur":1.54,"text":"around 3 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":76.74,"dur":1.0,"text":"Social media is very irritating because even though you're already resting","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":80.54,"dur":5.05,"text":"Some of your friends are still trying to reach out for you Making some chat or messaging you","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":85.58,"dur":2.46,"text":"At least 4 to 6 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":88.05,"dur":2.21,"text":"Five. Six hours.","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":90.26,"dur":3.46,"text":"I’m a doom scroller so I often use it,","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/006.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":93.72,"dur":2.75,"text":"and even in my office hours I use my phone","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/006.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":96.47,"dur":0.88,"text":"16 [hours]","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/006.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":98.39,"dur":5.5,"text":"But I'm a multimedia art student, so I have to be in front of my computer and stuff all the time","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/007.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":103.89,"dur":5.63,"text":"5 hours But that's not like a full 5 hour It's like one hour and then rest, one hour","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/007.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":111.28,"dur":0.67,"text":"Honestly, I'm not really using phone more often","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/007.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":115.7,"dur":1.17,"text":"I think I use it 8 hours in a day","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/007.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"}],"turns":[{"t":7.01,"dur":1.71,"text":"I think 12 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"host","why":"intro"},{"t":8.72,"dur":4.92,"text":"My time of sleep is eight hours Let's see... 16 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":13.64,"dur":0.96,"text":"2 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":15.93,"dur":1.08,"text":"8 Hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":17.02,"dur":1.17,"text":"1 Hour","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":18.18,"dur":3.92,"text":"I think about 6 hours straight","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":22.11,"dur":3.67,"text":"I only don’t use it when I'm sleeping because we are frontliners [civil service]","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":25.78,"dur":3.92,"text":"We get inquires, we get phone calls 24 hours a day","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":29.7,"dur":1.58,"text":"probably 8 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":32.66,"dur":1.17,"text":"8 hours","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":33.83,"dur":2.63,"text":"I don't have a phone","frame":"VjORHAjQqtU/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":36.45,"d